source_tag":"tformat","target":"在某个生物的身旁，召唤一个由纯粹的光线构成的，与你完全相似的完美复制体。\n\t\t这一镜像具有 %d 生命值，每回合从每个生物身上最多受到 1 点伤害，且免疫任何非直接伤害（地面效果，持续伤害，等等）\n\t\t当你释放任何法术的时候，镜像也会试图对同一目标释放这一法术，造成的伤害降低 66%%。如果它这么做了，它会流失 1 点生命值。如果不能的话，它则会嘲讽一个生物，将它的注意力集中在自己身上。\n\t\t只要镜像持续存在在战场上，你就会获得隐形技能所基于的隐形伤害加成，无论你是否隐形。\n\t\t这一技能无法在场上已经有镜像的时候释放，且只能在战斗中释放。镜像在脱战后快速消失。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2eda9de4a4e6c4b780820128322ecf48d70916dbeaa5da75ea89561286e823a0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0bcd577701d921d5d8e94c45ed92910ab48e68eda664841319813fc785df76dd","logical_entry_identity":"26fcd729aa512b9a7ea36d692ee182ec848dee70d6f1186cb7e8f9170a372577","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s holds %s %s close, cleansing %s of corruption!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s将%s %s紧贴自身，净化%s身上的腐化！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"234d67ef3a37e8afdc37425350f3427265fed65c3fa22a561f3ff22c7cd6fad2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0bce423a43133603c214f782c0e4d95016e9d28794fafff89386041349c9922a","logical_entry_identity":"5e00c0871364d4d5b3fa05f15bf8991d0d35f8dae210c15c06da0d99878e8539","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORANGE#Randart Data:#LAST# ","source_tag":"_t","target":"#ORANGE#随机神器数据：#LAST# "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9aa67862d5bd262793a719b7b464829396038f80f6aaf4edcd9bd2b8fac8c2b6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0bcf94fb468e23998b9da7a834f3588eef5686c8e09ce9619b328dd8dc2d88d1","logical_entry_identity":"bebfb047835d8383279c83c3fe353348b49ae0771b78efc6ffb2b9d5ea7f9cea","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ninurlhing","source_tag":"entity name","target":"林尔荷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b4913d6ae9d470f5be8ee55276bdd9e80c9c401a5e9ab4caf1bcce7b623ee370","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0bd268f2a20730d3cdd3a912ae8c4fd37132174e64703a996d5dd6e91c8f55ea","logical_entry_identity":"3d7b40cfc76fca71557c8fc9d4efe85bae6c10533666082ed224f1670c327acb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot switch equipm